{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__safety-net#card-zh","repo":"JohnXu22786/safety-net","commit":"a6686f16514304b930d4384a603bf2ac5ca67390","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Barricade 是一个接入 DSH 工具调用流程的命令分析插件，也提供独立 CLI。它在 shell 类工具执行前解析命令，并依据策略放行、拦截或交由宿主请求人工确认；内置分析覆盖常见 shell 命令结构、包装命令和多段管道。用户可调整工具名称、命令字段路径和分析等级，也可使用 hook 或 gate 命令行入口。适合希望在 agent 执行命令前加入策略判定的 DSH 使用者。需要 Node.js 18.13 或更高版本，不需要额外服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin.js:257","src/analyzer.js:106","src/policy.js:24"]}
{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__safety-net#card-en","repo":"JohnXu22786/safety-net","commit":"a6686f16514304b930d4384a603bf2ac5ca67390","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Barricade is a DSH plugin and CLI that analyzes shell commands before tools run. It allows, blocks, or requests host approval according to policy. It supports configurable tool names and command fields, plus hook and gate entry points. Requires Node.js 18.13+ and no external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin.js:257","src/analyzer.js:106","src/policy.js:24"]}
